  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot project to maintain and/or enhance the energy efficiency of replacement technologies and equipment in the context of HFC phase-down</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will prepare a comprehensive intervention to enhance energy efficiency in Brazil#s industrial refrigeration (IR) sector while supporting the transition to low-GWP refrigerants under the Kigali Amendment. Activities will include sectoral assessments, review of policy and regulatory frameworks, identification of financing mechanisms, stakeholder consultations, development of technical eligibility criteria, and preparation of a full-scale project aimed at accelerating the uptake of energy-efficient and climate-friendly refrigeration technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
